AltoReferralWhitelistAdapter::activateReferralWhitelist
├── when proof is invalid
│   └── it should revert
├── given caller is already whitelisted
│   └── it should revert
└── when activation is valid
    ├── when caller provides valid proof and is not whitelisted
    │   ├── it should set caller as whitelisted
    │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event
    ├── when multiple users activate with valid proofs
    │   ├── it should set each user as whitelisted
    │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event for each user
    └── when user activates after being removed from whitelist
        ├── it should re-whitelist the user
        └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event
